FileNotFoundError: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: '/proc/5/exe'

$ lean --version
error: failed to locate application

The managed command sandbox reports namespace-local PIDs but exposes an outer
PID namespace through /proc. Lean IO.appPath therefore cannot resolve its
executable. evidence/lean-pid-shim.c maps getpid() through /proc/*/status NSpid
for the Lean/Lake subprocess only.
